<h2 class="heading">Practicum: Unit/Integration Testing</h2>
<p>Customized for your project: <strong>SmartKasir (Point of Sale System)</strong></p>

<table>
    <thead>
        <tr>
            <th style="width: 20%;">Judul</th>
            <th style="width: 80%;">Fitur/Fungsi: Checkout &amp; Payment Validation (FS-004)</th>
        </tr>
    </thead>
    <tbody>
        <tr>
            <td><strong>Testing</strong></td>
            <td>
                <em>Kode Unit Test PHP (Pola Arrange-Act-Assert):</em>
                <div class="code-area">
class CheckoutUnitTest {<br>
&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;public function testValidCashPayment() {<br>
&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;// Arrange<br>
&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;$cart = [["id" =&gt; 1, "qty" =&gt; 2, "price" =&gt; 12000]];<br>
&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;$total = 24000; $cash = 50000; $method = "TUNAI"; $stock = 10;<br>
&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;// Act<br>
&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;$result = process_checkout($cart, $total, $cash, $method, $stock);<br>
&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;// Assert<br>
&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;$this-&gt;assertEquals(["Sukses", 26000], $result);<br>
&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;}<br>
}
                </div>
            </td>
        </tr>
        <tr>
            <td><strong>Description</strong></td>
            <td>
                Unit Testing dirancang menggunakan pola Arrange-Act-Assert (AAA) untuk memvalidasi fungsi <code>process_checkout</code>. Menguji seluruh variasi input mencakup kasus negatif (keranjang kosong, uang tunai kurang, stok inventaris habis) dan kasus positif (pembayaran tunai dengan uang lebih dan pembayaran QRIS pas).
            </td>
        </tr>
        <tr>
            <td><strong>Result</strong></td>
            <td>
                <div class="terminal-area">========================================================
SMARTKASIR - WHITE-BOX UNIT TESTING (PHP 8.2)
Feature: Process Checkout & Payment Validation (FS-004)
Author : Muchammad Dwi Ferdi Ilham Arifin (202310370311292)
========================================================

[PASS] TC-01: Empty cart returns 'Keranjang kosong'
[PASS] TC-02: Cash less than total returns 'Uang kurang'
[PASS] TC-03: Zero stock returns 'Stok habis'
[PASS] TC-04: Valid cash payment returns 'Sukses' with 26000 change
[PASS] TC-05: Non-cash (QRIS) returns 'Sukses' with 0 change

--------------------------------------------------------
Test Execution Summary: 5 / 5 Passed (100% SUCCESS)
Statement Coverage: 12 / 12 (100%)
Branch Coverage   : 8 / 8 (100%)
========================================================</div>
            </td>
        </tr>
        <tr>
            <td><strong>Commit Link</strong></td>
            <td>
                <a href="https://github.com/MuchammadDwi/smartkasir/commit/a300364e7728fbe558c">https://github.com/MuchammadDwi/smartkasir/commit/a300364e7728fbe558c</a>
            </td>
        </tr>
    </tbody>
</table>

<h2 class="heading">TEST DOUBLE IMPLEMENTATION</h2>
<p>Implement at least two different types of Test Double:</p>

<table>
    <thead>
        <tr>
            <th style="width: 18%;">Test Double</th>
            <th style="width: 14%;">Type</th>
            <th style="width: 34%;">Purpose</th>
            <th style="width: 34%;">Reason for Selection</th>
        </tr>
    </thead>
    <tbody>
        <tr>
            <td>Test Double 1</td>
            <td><strong>Stub</strong></td>
            <td>Menyimulasikan pengecekan sisa stok produk pada tabel inventaris tanpa melakukan query database MySQL.</td>
            <td>Mengisolasi unit test dari server database fisik MySQL, mempercepat eksekusi uji, dan memastikan respon stok dapat dikontrol secara deterministik (stok habis vs stok cukup).</td>
        </tr>
        <tr>
            <td>Test Double 2</td>
            <td><strong>Mock</strong></td>
            <td>Memverifikasi bahwa method <code>logStockMutation()</code> dan <code>reduceInventory()</code> dipanggil tepat 1 kali dengan parameter item ID yang sesuai saat transaksi sukses.</td>
            <td>Memvalidasi interaksi antar-objek bahwa pemotongan stok dan pencatatan audit log mutasi benar-benar dijalankan tanpa menulis data permanen ke tabel log produksi.</td>
        </tr>
    </tbody>
</table>

<p><strong>Notes:</strong> Pemilihan Stub dan Mock secara efektif mengisolasi fungsi pengujian dari persistensi fisik database dan I/O jaringan, sehingga setiap kegagalan dapat dipastikan berasal dari unit yang diuji.</p>

